      "type": "table",
      "level": null,
      "content": "<table><tr><td>参数名称</td><td>参数类型</td><td>参数范围</td><td>我的描述</td><td>参数示意图</td></tr><tr><td>集成电路引脚</td><td>物理结构参数</td><td>引脚数量、间距、长度等（如 SOP-8、QFN-24 等封装规格）</td><td>表示芯片类元器件的引脚布局，用于电气连接与封装识别</td><td><img src=\"https://xmind-parser.bj.bcebos.com/vlm_cloud/parseResult/task-kbj2R7563pzc4ovx8e0CKYfU4xWGKBwi/1-3.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAK7IDj758EUbA1igu04rHAh%2F2026-07-27T04%3A53%3A05Z%2F2592000%2F%2Feb3ef585cb8f9d42c6d03a0901ed25c447421d067485a8be38ccab31d07ed270\" ></td></tr><tr><td>旋转阀（或旋转执行机构）</td><td>运动结构参数</td><td>旋转角度（0° ~ 360°）、扭矩、转速等</td><td>表示可旋转的阀类或执行机构，用于流体控制或机械传动</td><td><img src=\"https://xmind-parser.bj.bcebos.com/vlm_cloud/parseResult/task-kbj2R7563pzc4ovx8e0CKYfU4xWGKBwi/1-5.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAK7IDj758EUbA1igu04rHAh%2F2026-07-27T04%3A53%3A05Z%2F2592000%2F%2Fbed92fe69b36170ed14190c9c955944850d93c7360926907d62919a4e60a693f\" ></td></tr><tr><td>层状流道（或多孔介质流道）</td><td>流体力学参数</td><td>流道宽度（如 38）、层数、孔隙率、流速范围等</td><td>表示多层结构的流体通道，常用于换热、过滤或流体分配场景</td><td><img src=\"https://xmind-parser.bj.bcebos.com/vlm_cloud/parseResult/task-kbj2R7563pzc4ovx8e0CKYfU4xWGKBwi/1-6.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAK7IDj758EUbA1igu04rHAh%2F2026-07-27T04%3A53%3A05Z%2F2592000%2F%2Ff58a100c3e775f2e0fe9e38c08181a3cf1548d245fefcdfb6e25faf03c7b88ee\" ></td></tr><tr><td>层状流道（或多孔介质流道）</td><td>几何坐标参数</td><td>坐标点 (x, y), x ∈ (-∞, +∞), y ∈ (-∞, +∞)</td><td>用于定位平面内点的位置，区分四个象限，图中示例点为 (2, 1)</td><td><img src=\"https://xmind-parser.bj.bcebos.com/vlm_cloud/parseResult/task-kbj2R7563pzc4ovx8e0CKYfU4xWGKBwi/1-10.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAK7IDj758EUbA1igu04rHAh%2F2026-07-27T04%3A53%3A05Z%2F2592000%2F%2F4a2a0a57ec1994765d18acfdf8ba15928289d590f7b922865ea273149f5540a1\" ></td></tr><tr><td>密封流道（或迷宫密封结构）</td><td>密封与流体参数</td><td>流道间隙、密封级数、介质压力、温度等</td><td>表示带有密封结构的流体通道，通过迷宫结构减少泄漏</td><td>- <img src=\"https://xmind-parser.bj.bcebos.com/vlm_cloud/parseResult/task-kbj2R7563pzc4ovx8e0CKYfU4xWGKBwi/1-11.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAK7IDj758EUbA1igu04r